at the running host version and flashes it — identity-gated, refused while a
print is active, Klipper service stopped during the flash and restarted after.
Slots already matching the host build are skipped unless <b>force</b> is ticked.
This works with Klipper shut down (the browser talks to this page, not to klippy).</p>
